# _redirects only accepts relative-path sources on Cloudflare Workers static
# assets (unlike classic Cloudflare Pages, absolute-URL sources are rejected
# at deploy time — "Only relative URLs are allowed"). That means it cannot
# express a cross-hostname redirect like apex -> www: by the time a request
# reaches this file's rules it has already been routed here by hostname.
#
# The apex (veloworkspaces.com) -> www (www.veloworkspaces.com) redirect is
# instead set up as a Cloudflare Redirect Rule at the zone level — see
# README.md "Routing www and the apex domain".

